# Section 1: Expected table (structure only; digits redacted)
cat > /workspace/expected.md <<'EOTABLE'
**Table 5. Build technologies adopted after Bazel abandonment**

| Domain    | Build Technology   | # Projects | Language(s)                    |
| --------- | ------------------ | ---------: | ------------------------------ |
| D1        | Go Build           |         ?? | Go                             |
| D1        | SPM                |          ? | Swift                          |
| D1        | Mage               |          ? | Go                             |
| D1        | SBT                |          ? | Scala                          |
